 Open Overleaf (ShareLatex) projects in VSCode, with full collaboration support.
 
+> [!IMPORTANT]
+> **国内版 / CN build (local patch, unofficial)**
+> This build defaults to the China-facing instance `https://cn.overleaf.com` instead of `https://www.overleaf.com`.
+> Compared with upstream `iamhyc.overleaf-workshop@0.15.10` it only differs in the default host, the hosts that offer
+> cookie-only login, and the one-time seeding/migration of that default host (existing hosts and sessions are kept);
+> see `PATCH-NOTES.md` in the fork checkout. Other instances can still be added via "Add New Server".
+
 ### User Guide
 
 The full user guide is available at [GitHub Wiki](https://github.com/overleaf-workshop/Overleaf-Workshop/wiki).
